      "content": "those are good starting points. i want to make it a bit punchier though. can you give me some specific ways to describe the opposing faction's worldview in the intro? i want to frame them as being stuck in these outdated, regressive patterns that the novel is trying to break down. what kind of language would make that critique feel more academically rigorous but also really biting?",
